      "created_at": "2017-01-13T00:09:27.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Ok. New question: what does “We’re working on this one” mean? I tried to target Dawn with a Tectonic Chokeslam, boosted by Predator’s Eye and Imbued Fire, but instead of showing the normal damage modifiers it just showed “We’re Working on This One” under it.</p>\n<p>I assume it’s a bug that’s been found, but not fixed?</p>",
